@page "/Account/RegisterConfirmation"

<PageTitle>Register confirmation</PageTitle>

<h1>Check your email</h1>

<p role="alert">
    If the address you entered can receive email, we've sent a link to confirm your account.
    Follow it to finish signing up.
</p>

@* Deliberately does not look up the account or show a confirmation link: doing so would let
   anyone confirm another person's address or learn whether an address is registered. *@
